Abstract:In recent years, China’ s urban rail transit has developed rapidly􀆰 Shield tunnel construction has obtained cer⁃
tain construction experience, and can basically safely pass through general risk sources􀆰 However, the research on shield
continuous crossing major risk sources is still rare, and it is also a research hotspot at present􀆰 This paper takes the shield
construction of a subway project in Shenzhen as an example, a total of 8 risk sources of continuous forward or side crossing
are required in 735m shield construction􀆰 By taking a series of quality and safety countermeasures to reduce the disturbance
to the stratum, the shield safety passes and all indicators are better than the control standard, which provides a reference for
shield construction under similar working conditions􀆰
Keywords:shield ;continuouscrossing; risk identification; complex environment; countermeasures
